<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R15 ha frammento"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un'espressione alla dichiarazione peritestuale contenuta nella stessa pubblicazione, che ne è un frammento e documenta l'impiego di una costrizione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R15 has fragment"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression to the peritextual declaration contained in the same publication, which is a fragment of it and documents the use of a constraint. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> .
